{"_note": "REAL X API v2 posts from the @SpaceX timeline, 12-22 Nov 2026 (Flight 15 window), captured by Tusk for the F15 photo narrative (/workspace/tusk/photo-pipeline/src/spacex-posts*.json). Post text and media unedited; author_id (SpaceX, user id 34743251) added because the timeline export omits it; posts outside 12-22 Nov dropped.", "data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120911872194973696"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-12T16:09:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120911969087607288"], "id": "2120911969087607288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 504, "impression_count": 1594677, "like_count": 18085, "quote_count": 144, "reply_count": 570, "retweet_count": 2022}, "text": "Development of the Starbase supercompute site is creating an opportunity to address decades of environmental neglect. \n\nPortions of the property were used for unauthorized dumping dating back to the 1960s. We're undertaking cleanup efforts to remove decades of accumulated debris, https://t.co/XNNkiJqp0I", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2120911969087607288", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121044412100673536", "3_2121044454844878848", "3_2121044476818808832", "3_2121044500411719680"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T00:56:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121044579470233638"], "id": "2121044579470233638", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1063, "impression_count": 3404576, "like_count": 26076, "quote_count": 624, "reply_count": 980, "retweet_count": 2760}, "text": "Ship 42 moves to the Starbase pad ahead of launch https://t.co/pMUFTHneJQ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121044579470233638", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121279581210464256"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T16:32:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121280048871473281"], "id": "2121280048871473281", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 667, "impression_count": 1345051, "like_count": 19996, "quote_count": 161, "reply_count": 501, "retweet_count": 1857}, "text": "Boca Chica Beach is not for sale, and SpaceX isn\u2019t attempting to buy it. The beach is an important part of the Rio Grande Valley community, and SpaceX is investing substantial resources to preserve and improve it \u2192 https://t.co/bvKDh6ytRN https://t.co/Gv11dYWEQk", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121280048871473281", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121360718788448256"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:29:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121369904469418085"], "id": "2121369904469418085", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 597, "impression_count": 705299, "like_count": 5603, "quote_count": 33, "reply_count": 96, "retweet_count": 626}, "text": "Take a look inside our Starlink manufacturing facility in Redmond, Washington, and watch the latest episode our Starship docuseries \u201cGo for Orbit\u201d \u2192 https://t.co/GZz3C4YLE2 https://t.co/PrTK0XQ6kY", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121369904469418085", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121371892678557696"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:38:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121372108441931940"], "id": "2121372108441931940", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 202, "impression_count": 640908, "like_count": 4549, "quote_count": 28, "reply_count": 97, "retweet_count": 432}, "text": "Today\u2019s flight will deploy 26 @Starlink V3 satellites, furthering our goal of Starlink becoming 51% of the internet https://t.co/uoTmNTJ3ry", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121372108441931940", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121360763097067520"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:39:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121372407529459831"], "id": "2121372407529459831", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 449, "impression_count": 893428, "like_count": 5840, "quote_count": 49, "reply_count": 128, "retweet_count": 649}, "text": "The mission profile for Starship Flight 15 https://t.co/qTZMaoywkW", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121372407529459831", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121374662450159616"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:48:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121374779680964991"], "id": "2121374779680964991", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1132, "impression_count": 1386107, "like_count": 24071, "quote_count": 436, "reply_count": 488, "retweet_count": 3033}, "text": "Liftoff of Starship! https://t.co/lc7UtE6H7z", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121374779680964991", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121375313750024192"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:51:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121375384793231499"], "id": "2121375384793231499", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 347, "impression_count": 948569, "like_count": 10238, "quote_count": 84, "reply_count": 182, "retweet_count": 1061}, "text": "Hot-staging separation! Starship\u2019s Raptor engines have ignited, and the Super Heavy is boosting back towards Starbase for a catch https://t.co/GySjTZg7HO", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121375384793231499", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121376252674367488"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:55:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121376372576915909"], "id": "2121376372576915909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 443, "impression_count": 1293591, "like_count": 11302, "quote_count": 238, "reply_count": 678, "retweet_count": 1060}, "text": "Super Heavy has diverted to an offshore splashdown in the Gulf https://t.co/1M2xn7NYJA", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121376372576915909", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121376687963439104"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T22:57:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121376821635936710"], "id": "2121376821635936710", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 213, "impression_count": 841332, "like_count": 8780, "quote_count": 61, "reply_count": 176, "retweet_count": 798}, "text": "Starship\u2019s ascent burn is complete. Starship is now on a planned suborbital trajectory as teams check systems to confirm we are good to proceed to orbit today https://t.co/N38rluDxtc", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121376821635936710", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121380459003133952"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:11:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121380531640369470"], "id": "2121380531640369470", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 121, "impression_count": 596038, "like_count": 5369, "quote_count": 33, "reply_count": 88, "retweet_count": 523}, "text": "Go for orbit! Starship will soon perform a short burn with a single Raptor engine to enter an ~275 km orbit of Earth https://t.co/xSzBAnH7re", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121380531640369470", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121381488885432320"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:15:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121381593768186362"], "id": "2121381593768186362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 173, "impression_count": 763600, "like_count": 6979, "quote_count": 67, "reply_count": 139, "retweet_count": 636}, "text": "Starship performs its orbital insertion burn and enters orbit of Earth for the second time https://t.co/U8tAqw0yHz", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121381593768186362", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121384344782798848"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:27:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121384424558453096"], "id": "2121384424558453096", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 224, "impression_count": 1195685, "like_count": 7955, "quote_count": 65, "reply_count": 210, "retweet_count": 829}, "text": "Starship is now deploying its payload of 26 @Starlink V3 satellites. This deployment sequence will take ~42 minutes https://t.co/h0XEdXub7S", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121384424558453096", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121387246066569217"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-13T23:39:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121387537235406928"], "id": "2121387537235406928", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 376, "impression_count": 5566413, "like_count": 7811, "quote_count": 72, "reply_count": 159, "retweet_count": 834}, "text": "Views of Starship in space as @Starlink deploy continues https://t.co/pd6FYvDo0D", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121387537235406928", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121394173030920192"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T00:06:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121394268652839309"], "id": "2121394268652839309", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 260, "impression_count": 1142420, "like_count": 12950, "quote_count": 148, "reply_count": 263, "retweet_count": 1322}, "text": "Payload deploy complete. All 26 @Starlink V3 satellites are in orbit https://t.co/y2ffFifGdo", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121394268652839309", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121434374503632896"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T02:46:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121434583178875245"], "id": "2121434583178875245", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 253, "impression_count": 924789, "like_count": 8844, "quote_count": 46, "reply_count": 182, "retweet_count": 813}, "text": "Live views of Starship in orbit brought to you by @Starlink https://t.co/7RW3I1LG2e", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121434583178875245", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121437309597859840", "3_2121437347984068608", "3_2121437398726787073", "3_2121437464401199104"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T02:58:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121437515819159871"], "id": "2121437515819159871", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1397, "impression_count": 1253395, "like_count": 17916, "quote_count": 194, "reply_count": 334, "retweet_count": 2046}, "text": "Liftoff of Starship Flight 15 https://t.co/OWqYkqfUG8", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121437515819159871", "author_id": "34743251"},