567, "impression_count": 1726045, "like_count": 16457, "quote_count": 169, "reply_count": 438, "retweet_count": 1717}, "text": "Flight 15 Update: Starship coasting in orbit, still looking good for return to launch site today. Pad and tower systems are go for catch. https://t.co/vMkjoZdxa6", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121629656868614213", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121629793401610240", "3_2121629903388852224"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T15:42:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121629958036492590"], "id": "2121629958036492590", "in_reply_to_user_id": "34743251", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 213, "impression_count": 483786, "like_count": 7112, "quote_count": 36, "reply_count": 135, "retweet_count": 561}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121629656868614213", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Following Booster splashdown in the Gulf yesterday, SpaceX recovery teams were immediately onsite to safe the area.\n\nAt the same time, our Environmental Health and Safety team is ensuring any debris that washes onshore is recovered. We\u2019re committed to protecting and restoring https://t.co/XHi303vpZg", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121629958036492590", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121683901575999488"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T19:18:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121684113526858011"], "id": "2121684113526858011", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 684, "impression_count": 2628819, "like_count": 16485, "quote_count": 367, "reply_count": 543, "retweet_count": 1772}, "text": "Teams have polled go to return Starship to the launch site at Starbase https://t.co/BsrI3nLXFe", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121684113526858011", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121701005490544640"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T20:25:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121701161040556374"], "id": "2121701161040556374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 265, "impression_count": 1080523, "like_count": 8600, "quote_count": 95, "reply_count": 161, "retweet_count": 809}, "text": "Good deorbit burn. Starship is on course to reenter Earth\u2019s atmosphere ahead of a planned catch at Starbase in ~1 hour https://t.co/eQPUx9klvM", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121701161040556374", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121709285495459841"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T20:58:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121709368945385477"], "id": "2121709368945385477", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 381, "impression_count": 1399937, "like_count": 11296, "quote_count": 115, "reply_count": 293, "retweet_count": 1132}, "text": "Starship is reentering Earth\u2019s atmosphere https://t.co/b0M87R1SHn", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121709368945385477", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121714248523153408"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T21:18:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121714305968304321"], "id": "2121714305968304321", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 658, "impression_count": 1369085, "like_count": 19526, "quote_count": 146, "reply_count": 437, "retweet_count": 1560}, "text": "Starship is executing a banking maneuver and final approach as it returns to Starbase for a catch https://t.co/E1WpGrlfaz", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121714305968304321", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121715092903596032"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T21:21:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121715216597827756"], "id": "2121715216597827756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13920, "impression_count": 17762131, "like_count": 141322, "quote_count": 9118, "reply_count": 6802, "retweet_count": 27374}, "text": "Mechazilla catches Starship! Congratulations to the entire SpaceX team on this incredible achievement! https://t.co/YJzmGUZb2B", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121715216597827756", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121736288374059008"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-14T22:53:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121738348804857963"], "id": "2121738348804857963", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1145, "impression_count": 1887477, "like_count": 27760, "quote_count": 527, "reply_count": 924, "retweet_count": 3630}, "text": "On Friday, November 13, Starship lifted off from Starbase, Texas on its 15th flight. \n\nOn Saturday, November 14, Starship returned to Starbase, Texas, and changed everything \u2192 https://t.co/K5XRci6bnw https://t.co/smWs1qSDuZ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2121738348804857963", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122001603070681088"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:20:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122001927861158109"], "id": "2122001927861158109", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1659, "impression_count": 992165, "like_count": 10125, "quote_count": 227, "reply_count": 480, "retweet_count": 1210}, "text": "New level unlocked \u2192 https://t.co/Bg3BBDKqh5 https://t.co/LCxZqDKE5Q", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2122001927861158109", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122351216583720961", "3_2122351261336965120", "3_2122351322917740545", "3_2122351322917752832", "3_2122351322917670912", "3_2122351322921844736", "3_2122351451108245505", "3_2122351450999177217", "3_2122351451020156928"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-16T15:34:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122352509721190612"], "id": "2122352509721190612", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1599, "impression_count": 1340354, "like_count": 19359, "quote_count": 204, "reply_count": 367, "retweet_count": 2190}, "text": "Starship landing burn on final approach for catch https://t.co/rdPsC4IIuX", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2122352509721190612", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122446732218728448", "3_2122446762916872192", "3_2122446809259819008", "3_2122446842008829952", "3_2122446873017401345", "3_2122446896006393856"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-16T21:49:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122446937286971592"], "id": "2122446937286971592", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1443, "impression_count": 963321, "like_count": 22624, "quote_count": 215, "reply_count": 485, "retweet_count": 2351}, "text": "Starship 42 back on Earth https://t.co/OEkFHSM5GJ", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2122446937286971592", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2122793616175255552"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-17T20:47:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122793780810264837"], "id": "2122793780810264837", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 143, "impression_count": 1030467, "like_count": 7354, "quote_count": 61, "reply_count": 194, "retweet_count": 764}, "text": "After 34 days docked to the @Space_Station, the Dragon spacecraft supporting SpaceX\u2019s 35th  Commercial Resupply Services mission for @NASA is targeted to undock from the orbiting lab as soon as Wednesday, November 18 \u2192 https://t.co/tnMukzSxui https://t.co/OhkzWO1fRh", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2122793780810264837", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2123097900406157312", "3_2123097922187190272", "3_2123097943263633408"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-18T16:56:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123097995679867195"], "id": "2123097995679867195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1249, "impression_count": 1391480, "like_count": 21715, "quote_count": 283, "reply_count": 696, "retweet_count": 2158}, "text": "The Starbase tower team on location with the first caught Starship\ud83c\udf4c https://t.co/ar7y6ccgZr", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2123097995679867195", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2123809458090373120", "3_2123809480290746368"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-20T16:03:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123809508187078839"], "id": "2123809508187078839", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 784, "impression_count": 934730, "like_count": 18813, "quote_count": 172, "reply_count": 532, "retweet_count": 1666}, "text": "Members of the Starship production team with Starship 42 before its launch https://t.co/1yPiV8h5Zu", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2123809508187078839", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2123898335320772608", "3_2123898370045399040", "3_2123898397270695937", "3_2123898431907254272", "3_2123898492007448576"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-20T21:57:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123898539352756617"], "id": "2123898539352756617", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1047, "impression_count": 1235565, "like_count": 16339, "quote_count": 190, "reply_count": 347, "retweet_count": 1727}, "text": "Raptor engines powering Super Heavy and Starship on Flight 15 https://t.co/99ytd8a4Tm", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2123898539352756617", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2123982094065926146"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21T03:33:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2123983173038034948"], "id": "2123983173038034948", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 109, "impression_count": 469788, "like_count": 6057, "quote_count": 43, "reply_count": 181, "retweet_count": 510}, "text": "All systems are looking good, and weather is favorable for liftoff. Propellant load is about to begin for Falcon 9\u2019s launch of the USSF-317 mission from California \u2192 https://t.co/LRc4X7tygw https://t.co/4jYQrVJZnt", "url": "https://x.com/i/status/2123983173038034948", "author_id": "34743251"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2124122343706435584", "3_2124122381383761920", "3_2124122387150938112", "3_2124122393845116928"]}, "created_at": "2026-11-21T12:47:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2124122550339002718"], "id": "2124122550339002718", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 146, "impression_count": 677453, "like_count": 5511, "quote_count": 84, "reply_count": 246, "retweet_count": 602}, "text": "Falcon 9 launches USSF-317 to orbit from pad 4E in California https://t.co/KDQs8l